{"id":"H3469","lemma":"יִשְׁעִי","transliteration":"yishi","sayIt":"yish-I","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Ishi","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 1Ch.2.31;\nson of: Appaim (H0649);\nfather of: Sheshan (H8348)\n§ Ishi = \"He saves me\"\n1) son of Appaim, one of the line of Jerahmeel of the house of Hezron\n2) a chief of Manasseh and head of a family on the east of Jordan\n3) a chief of Judah, father of Zoheth\n4) a chief of Simeon and head of a family","glosses":["ishi"],"count":4,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ch-2","v":31,"renderings":{"bsb":"Ishi","kjv":"Ishi"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-4","v":20,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Ishi","kjv":"of Ishi"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-4","v":42,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Ishi","kjv":"of Ishi"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-5","v":24,"renderings":{"bsb":"Ishi","kjv":"and Ishi"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Chronicles 2:31","note":"The son of Appaim: Ishi. The son of Ishi: Sheshan. The son of Sheshan: Ahlai.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H0649","lemma":"אַפַּיִם","transliteration":"appayim","gloss":"Appaim"},{"id":"H1132","lemma":"בֶּן־זוֹחֵת","transliteration":"ben-zochet","gloss":"Ben-zoheth"},{"id":"H2105","lemma":"זוֹחֵת","transliteration":"zochet","gloss":"Zoheth"},{"id":"H8348","lemma":"שֵׁשָׁן","transliteration":"sheshan","gloss":"Sheshan"},{"id":"H6410","lemma":"פְּלַטְיָ֫הוּ","transliteration":"pelatyah","gloss":"Pelatiah"},{"id":"H5294","lemma":"נְעַרְיָה","transliteration":"nearyah","gloss":"Neariah"},{"id":"H7509","lemma":"רְפָיָה","transliteration":"rephayah","gloss":"Rephaiah"},{"id":"H5816","lemma":"עֻזִּיאֵל","transliteration":"uzziel","gloss":"Uzziel"}],"senses":[{"id":"H3469H","gloss":"Ishi","relation":"H3469H ="},{"id":"H3469I","gloss":"Ishi","relation":"H3469I ="},{"id":"H3469J","gloss":"Ishi","relation":"H3469J ="}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}